{"id":"c84002bb64575fc3","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-local-finite.md","title":"thm-local-finite","display":"thm-local-finite","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-locally-finite]]"],"display":"thm-local-finite","label":"93-thm-local-finite","aliases":["93-thm-local-finite"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9464b912634e40b\" href=\"?note=c9464b912634e40b\" title=\"93-df-locally-finite\">93-df-locally-finite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-local-finite"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-local-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-local-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-local-finite-thm-local-finite\">thm-local-finite <code>thm-local-finite</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9464b912634e40b\" href=\"?note=c9464b912634e40b\" title=\"93-df-locally-finite\">93-df-locally-finite</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9464b912634e40b\" href=\"?note=c9464b912634e40b\" title=\"93-df-locally-finite\">93-df-locally-finite</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}local\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}local\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"thm-local-finite-thm-local-finite","text":"thm-local-finite `thm-local-finite`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-locally-finite","status":"resolved","id":"c9464b912634e40b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-locally-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-locally-finite","status":"resolved","id":"c9464b912634e40b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate sourced through [[93-df-locally-finite]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-locally-finite","status":"resolved","id":"c9464b912634e40b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}$, and $\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ are sourced through [[93-df-locally-finite]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}local\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A}(X))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c9464b912634e40b"]}